  {
   "id": "mato-anomalies-212050@post-2023-09-21",
   "gameId": "mato-anomalies-212050",
   "displayName": "MATO ANOMALIES - Post-release Patch Notes",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-21T13:02:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "September 2023",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fellow Rift travelers and detectives, here is what today's Patch brings:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed an issue where the achievements “All-knowing” and “Mind Hunter” could not be obtained.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After applying this patch, please load a game profile that meets the conditions, and these achievements should be awarded.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed a rare issue where the Mind/Hack session may be broken if Smoker’s card “Rage” is used against the demon “Puzzle” during the side quest “The Beautiful Thing” in Chapter 7.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed an issue where Mist’s voice (the first line) may not play properly upon encountering an elite enemy in combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Improved the legibility of combat UI by increasing font sizes, adding font shadows, and tuning panel transparency and sizes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. [Steam Deck] Improved the legibility of Mind/Hack game UI by increasing font sizes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "6. [Steam Deck] Game graphics settings on Steam Deck are now saved independently and no longer synchronized with Steam PC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it for now, enjoy playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
