  {
   "id": "mato-anomalies-212050@patch-2023-06-29",
   "gameId": "mato-anomalies-212050",
   "displayName": "Patch of June, 2023",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-29T08:41:30.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Now the in-game view (camera) rotates with panning of mouse by default. The previous camera rotation mode (hold right mouse button and pan) can still be set in the Options - Gameplay menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Added the Infinite Domain (a roguelike dungeon mode). Talk to \"No. 453\" in South 2nd Road to access this mode – when you're in Chapter 4 and beyond of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Added a NPC to the greenhouse area of the city scene \"Mercury Street\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. For owners of the game Art Book, a standalone copy (PDF file) will be downloaded automatically to the game folder (..\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Mato Anomalies)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fixed a bug in Chapter 6 where entering and leaving the Lair can interrupt quests.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Added game logic to support future DLC, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Other minor fixes and improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
